          <Pad Id="K6J33nvWTeVSSfobtUwgHM" Bounds="85,85,520,97" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Polyline [Qt]&#xD;&#xA;- Points: a Spread of positions, drawn as one stroked chain&#xD;&#xA;- Closed: joins the last point to the first&#xD;&#xA;- Stroke Width, Cap (line ends) and Join (corners): Miter, Bevel or Round&#xD;&#xA;- Dash and Trim like Line, Position and rotation via Transform">
